      "en": "So he sent his brothers away, and they departed. He said to them, “See that you don’t quarrel on the way.”",
      "ko": "이에 형들을 돌려 보내며 그들에게 이르되 당신들은 노중에서 다투지 말라 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "36b1aa9c0dd0709385a811af091a9ae1e38f7cb709ab359cdf0740f47eb9420b",
      "translation_text_hash": "3859472ad8244bbccaeca6a626c3ee529845a0ee2d549bad8c3844f30d4c967c",
